        // RAN: keel show control-structure . : stepTwoGate all 8 holds=true; per controller processModel/actuators/responsibilities present; actuators and otherInputsOutputs arrays present; channel in absentRoles; cargo test --release --lib control_structure 8 passed; stpa_diagram.py renders with channel absent; SOP + stpa-self skill doc lines added
